 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "We have come to know this deep truth",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Believing the love that He shows us",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God is love, simple and true",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Remain in it, let His peace flow through",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In this way, love is brought to completion",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Giving us confidence on judgment day",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As He is, so are we in this world",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Walking together in the light",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We love because He first loved us",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We love because He first loved us",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No fear remains where His grace is found",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Perfect love drives the fear away",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "There is no fear in this holy love",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It drives out the dread of punishment",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The one who fears has not been made complete",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But we stand secure in His presence",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We love because He first loved us",
